{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06637","headline":"献华阴罗丞别 · 储光羲","name":"献华阴罗丞别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"华山薄游者，玄发当青春。\n道德同仙吏，尊卑即丈人。\n县城俯京路，获见官舍里。\n淹留琼树枝，谑浪春泉水。\n昔余在天目，总角奉游从。\n寒暑递来往，今复莲花峰。\n别情无远近，道别方愁予。\n孰想古人言，乃知悲风雨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06637.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06637","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}